<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:26:57 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>傍晚散步</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff5b8e3202f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🚶🏻晚间散步&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🚶🏻Evening walk" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6aff5b8e3202f.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:26:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>缤纷色彩</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff58dee2d82</link><description>&lt;p&gt;所有美丽的色彩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A bunch of little cups of tattoo ink" height="1280" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aff58dee2d82.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:15:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>紫色路牌与意外入镜工人</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff2f7f827b5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我喜欢他们的紫色路牌，完全没注意到那个工人哈哈&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A corner in a suburban town with a stop light and an arch over the road" height="1232" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aff2f7f827b5.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:18:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>家电店购物</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff2b930783e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在电器商店里&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Knitted potato with positive message" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/petebrown/6aff2b930783e.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://petebrown.some.pics"&gt;@petebrown&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:02:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Hillthorn游戏卡牌玩法截图</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff16d1e6d86</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;一张来自Hillthorn的截图，展示了游戏玩法，包括你可以互动的不同卡片。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A screenshot from Hillthorn showing the gamesplay, including the different cards you can interact with." height="800" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bookmonster/6aff16d1e6d86.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bookmonster.some.pics"&gt;@bookmonster&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:33:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>客户Abigail进入办公室</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff16362f1ff</link><description>&lt;p&gt;来自Hillthorn的截图，显示你的客户Abigail正进入你的办公室。她的面容隐藏在阴影中，只能辨认出她的眼睛。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Screenshot from Hillthorn, showing Abigail, your client, entering your office. Her features are in shadow, only her eyes can be made out." height="800" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bookmonster/6aff16362f1ff.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bookmonster.some.pics"&gt;@bookmonster&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:31:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>小障碍需低头</title><link>https://some.pics/6aff129c4a027</link><description>&lt;p&gt;没什么比路上有点小障碍需要低头钻过去更让人兴奋的了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A narrow path covered with brown fallen leaves snakes through a dense thicket of bare trees and brush with some green leaves still clinging to the branches." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6aff129c4a027.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:16:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>仪式后也要爱护环境</title><link>https://some.pics/6afefdb618cf5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你对一个地方的关怀在仪式之后也同样重要。收拾好你的丝带，离开前收集好所有碎片，这是对你在其中练习巫术的户外场所表达感谢的贴心方式。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy scene of a witch collecting ribbons and paper scraps into a basket atop a sleeping stone giant, with a brown rabbit, clover, distant waterfalls, charcoal cliffs, rose-pink clouds, ivory lettering, and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Your care for a place matters after the ritual, too. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afefdb618cf5.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:46:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日对应精油推荐</title><link>https://some.pics/6afed81fc799e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月19日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝色 · 罗勒 · 丁香花蕾精油&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 19, 2026. Color: Blue — peace, truth, intuition, dreams. Plant: Basil (Ocimum basilicum) — prosperity, protection, love, success. Oil: Clove Bud essential oil — protection, prosperity. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afed81fc799e.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:06:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>久违的跑步</title><link>https://some.pics/6afe9e888087c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🏃🏻 好久不见了。都一周了？！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🏃🏻 It’s been a while. A week?!" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6afe9e888087c.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:27 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>